  "summary": {
    "text": "Gemini 3.7 Flash is a multimodal reasoning model in Google's Gemini Flash line, released on 13 August 2026 and based on Gemini 3.6 Flash. Google positions it for coding and agents; it was offered through the Gemini API, Google Antigravity and Gemini Enterprise, and in the Gemini app it powers Gemini Spark for Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers.",
